# Palash-AI 🌐🎙️

### Offline Speech-to-Speech Language Translation System

Palash-AI is an AI-powered **offline speech-to-speech language conversion system** designed to enable multilingual communication without requiring a continuous internet connection.

The project focuses on capturing spoken language, converting speech into text, translating it into the target language, and generating spoken output — all while prioritizing **offline processing, accessibility, and low-connectivity environments**.

> 🚀 **Palash-AI was developed as a prototype for the Smart India Hackathon (SIH) project and is being further developed toward a dedicated mobile application.**

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 🎙️ **Speech Input**
  - Captures spoken language from the user's microphone.

- 📝 **Speech Recognition**
  - Converts spoken input into machine-readable text.

- 🌍 **Multilingual Translation**
  - Translates the recognized speech into the selected target language.

- 🔊 **Speech Output**
  - Converts the translated text back into speech.

- 📴 **Offline Processing**
  - Designed to perform core language-conversion operations without depending on continuous internet connectivity.

- ⚡ **Real-Time Interaction**
  - Designed for conversational, speech-to-speech translation.

- 📱 **Mobile Application Direction**
  - The current implementation serves as a prototype for a dedicated mobile application.

---

## 🔄 How It Works

```text
        🎙️ User Speech
              │
              ▼
       ┌───────────────┐
       │ Speech-to-Text│
       └───────┬───────┘
               │
               ▼
        📝 Source Text
               │
               ▼
       ┌───────────────┐
       │  Translation  │
       │    Engine     │
       └───────┬───────┘
               │
               ▼
        🌍 Translated Text
               │
               ▼
       ┌───────────────┐
       │ Text-to-Speech│
       └───────┬───────┘
               │
               ▼
        🔊 Spoken Output
